5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. Let's try to keep a calm and clear head as we begin. I'm looking forward to a thoughtful discussion.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. A logical approach is the only way to find the werewolf. Let's all be honest and observant so we can reach the right conclusion together.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready! This is like a big mystery game, right? I'll help find the werewolf! Let's all be super careful and look for any weird clues!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's stay focused and observe each other's behavior carefully. It's better to be cautious from the start.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A mystery game indeed, Rin. I quite like the enthusiasm. Let us maintain this elegant composure; logic and a touch of patience should lead us to the truth without too much chaos.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Since we have no information yet, I believe it is best to listen and observe. I wonder if anyone has a particular strategy they would like to suggest for our first few days.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I think we should focus on identifying contradictions in our statements. Since the Seer will have information tomorrow, we should pay close attention to who tries to lead the vote or deflect suspicion.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"I'll be watching everyone's faces! If someone looks nervous or says something silly, I'll be the first to notice. I'm going to be a super-detective!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Watching faces might be difficult, Rin, but your energy is helpful. I think Mizuki is right; we should prioritize consistency. For now, I'll just keep listening to see how everyone's logic holds up.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Consistency is indeed the cornerstone of any investigation. I shall be observing the subtle shifts in our rhetoric. It is often the most polished facade that hides the most interesting secrets, wouldn't you agree?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,It seems we are all in agreement regarding the importance of observation. I will continue to listen quietly and reflect on our words as we move toward the first night.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we've established our general approach, I'll spend the rest of today analyzing the dynamics of our group. Let's see who feels the most pressure once the first result is revealed tomorrow.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm already analyzing! Everyone is being so polite and calm, but that's almost too suspicious, isn't it? I'll keep my eyes wide open for any little slips!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"Rin, being too polite isn't necessarily suspicious, but your intuition is interesting. I'll also keep an eye on how the atmosphere changes once we have actual information to work with.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Your intuition is quite sharp, Rin. Indeed, a surface of perfect harmony can be rather unsettling. I shall enjoy seeing which of us maintains this poise when the stakes become tangible tomorrow.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we have set a good foundation for our discussions. I will now step back and prepare for the night. I wish you all a peaceful evening.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'm satisfied with our initial alignment. Let's see what the first day brings and how the information unfolds. I'll be watching closely.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm going to sleep now, but I'll be dreaming of clues! Goodnight everyone! I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"I'll be doing the same. Let's hope for a productive day tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A peaceful evening to you all as well. I shall retire now, pondering the delightful contradictions we may encounter tomorrow. Sleep well, everyone; the game truly begins when the sun rises.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
